        sur la <a href="{{ faq_url }}">FAQ g&eacute;n&eacute;rale</a>.
      {%- else -%}
        Questions about the trial, warranty, delivery and certification are detailed on the
        <a href="{{ faq_url }}">general FAQ</a>.
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% render 'learn-product-cta',
   handles: 'antared-desk-red-light-therapy-panel,antared-sauna-dome-infrared-red-light-pemf,antared-pano-ultra',
   heading_fr: 'Chaque appareil de la gamme a d&#251; justifier sa place.',
